# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks these files out with CRLF on Windows
# while the repository stores LF, and Biome — which formats to LF — reports
# every file as misformatted. Fixing that in the working tree achieved nothing,
# because the next checkout converted it straight back.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
